## ⚡ Motor & Navigation Logic Table

| Gaze Direction Signal | Serial Character | Left Motor Pin (`RB6`/`RB7`) | Right Motor Pin (`RB5`/`RB4`) | Wheelchair Movement |
| :--- | :---: | :---: | :---: | :--- |
| **UP** | `'U'` | ON | ON | Forward |
| **DWN** | `'D'` | Reverse | Reverse | Reverse |
| **LFT** | `'L'` | ON | OFF | Left Turn |
| **RGT** | `'R'` | OFF | ON | Right Turn |
| **Closed / Stop** | `'S'` | OFF | OFF | Full Stop |

