## 📦 Directory Overview

* **`matlab/`**: MATLAB GUI callbacks, calibration module, iris centroid calculation, and gaze vector mapping routines[cite: 2, 3, 11, 12, 14].
* **`firmware/`**: PIC C code compiled using HI-TECH C compiler targetting `PIC16F877A` / `PIC16F873A`[cite: 19, 38].
* **`docs/`**: Circuit schematics, power management layout, and structural block diagrams[cite: 30, 33, 34].

