## 🚀 Getting Started

### Prerequisites

* **MATLAB** (R2010b or newer) with Image Acquisition and Image Processing Toolboxes installed[cite: 2, 14, 27].
* **HI-TECH C Compiler / MPLAB IDE** for PIC microcontroller code synthesis[cite: 19].
* **Hardware:**
  * PIC16F877A / PIC16F873A Microcontroller[cite: 30, 38]
  * Zigbee Wireless Modules[cite: 27, 30]
  * MAX232 Transceiver IC & RS232-to-USB Converter[cite: 34, 35]
  * USB CMOS Web Camera[cite: 30, 37]
  * 12V DC Motors & Relay Driver Module (ULN2803)[cite: 33, 38]

